    "md_es": [
      "**Con *play*:** deportes sin artículo → *play football, play tennis*. Instrumentos con *the* → *play the guitar, play the piano*.",
      "",
      "**Con otros verbos:** *read books · watch films · swim · cook · dance · sing · go for a walk*.",
      "",
      "**Ojo:** *listen **to** music* (siempre con *to*).",
      "",
      "**Pregunta:** *What do you do in your free time?*",
      "",
      "Pronunciación: *guitar* → gi-TAR · *music* → MIÚ-sik."
    ],
